Retrieved: 2026-11-14
Credit:    Hermit Dave, FrequencyWords; underlying text from OpenSubtitles (https://www.opensubtitles.org).
Changes:   Only the first column (the word) was kept; the counts were dropped. The lists are filtered and truncated as below.

Selection (reproducible with build-common-words.sh in this directory): per language, take the words in descending
frequency, keep only those consisting of letters only (\p{L}, no digits, apostrophes or hyphens) that are already
lower case, and keep the first 20,000 of them.

These five files are data files under CC-BY-SA 4.0 and stay separable from the code; share-alike applies to them
and to adaptations of them, not to the code that reads them.
